[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4405343872","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119333#issuecomment-4405343872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119333","id":4405343872,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBpQ2gA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-08T09:33:57Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T09:33:57Z","body":"> `DisplayServer.window_set_position(centered_position, screen_index)`\n\nThis is not how this function is called, the second argument is window ID not a screen ID.\n\nAnd your code is not moving window to specific screen, it's setting position relative to virtual desktop (0,0 of the virtual desktop is not always part of any screen).\n\nIf you want to place window on a specific screen do:\n```gdscript\nvar screen_position = DisplayServer.screen_get_position(screen_index)\nvar screen_size: Vector2i = DisplayServer.screen_get_size(screen_index)\nvar window_size: Vector2i = DisplayServer.window_get_size()\nvar centered_position: Vector2i = (screen_size - window_size) / 2.0\n\nDisplayServer.window_set_position(screen_position + centered_position)\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4405343872/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4405788219","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119333#issuecomment-4405788219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119333","id":4405788219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBpr-Ow","user":{"login":"RianovRV1","id":3650833,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTA4MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3650833?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1","html_url":"https://github.com/RianovRV1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RianovRV1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-08T10:43:18Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T10:43:18Z","body":"Ah my bad, thank  you for the correction there.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4405788219/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"mi